pg_accel NOTICE
===============

This file attributes third-party components incorporated into or linked by
pg_accel source and release packages. The exact runtime libraries and generated
device artifacts vary by selected AdaptiveCpp backend. SPDX identifiers follow
https://spdx.org/licenses/.

The AdaptiveCpp fork pin referenced below is:
  repository: https://github.com/yocontra/AdaptiveCpp
  branch:     fork-safe-metal
  commit:     456ae6910720810f5fe59f160e6707d46bb8e5f0
The repository-root `.acpp-version` file is the source of truth for this exact
pin. AdaptiveCpp license and bundled-component sources are available from that
commit under its `external/`, `src/`, and license files.

