5. H3 Core Library
----------------------------------------------------------------------
SPDX:    Apache-2.0
Role:    H3 lat/lng-to-cell indexing logic and lookup tables are used by
         the GPU H3 bulk kernel. The device headers are derived from the
         H3 C core call chain that h3-pg exposes through PostgreSQL.
Source:  https://github.com/uber/h3
         Local build provenance: h3-pg 4.2.3 fetches H3 Core into
         `.pgaccel/build/h3-pg-probe/build/_deps/h3-src`.

