Other dependencies
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The full transitive crate graph is pinned by `Cargo.lock` and license-audited by
`cargo deny check` against `deny.toml`; `cargo audit` scans the same graph for
RustSec advisories. The repository exposes these required release checks as
`just deny` and `just audit`. A license summary can be reproduced with
`cargo deny list`.
